@startuml
title Visitor path — README to dated status and next steps
actor Visitor
participant "README.md" as README
participant "mkdocs.yml" as Config
participant "Material + main.html" as Theme
participant "docs/index.md" as Landing
participant "extra.css" as Styles
participant "security.md / roadmap.md" as Trust

Visitor -> README : open repository
README -> Landing : Documentation link (site URL)
Config -> Landing : nav.Home resolves index.md
Theme -> Landing : render with extrahead metadata
Theme -> Landing : native skip container gets Home H1 link via document$ (bounded accessibility fix)
Styles -> Landing : .kusd-home layout
Landing -> Visitor : status, mechanism, Kaspa/EVM boundary
Visitor -> Landing : activate CTA
Landing -> Trust : security limits / readiness-gated roadmap
Trust -> Visitor : dated evidence and private reporting channel
@enduml
